cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

title: "Viral transcriptional regulators extensively rewire host pathways through diverse mechanisms"

abstract: >-
  Computational pipeline and analysis scripts for the functional
  characterization of viral transcriptional regulators (vTRs), integrating
  bulk RNA barcoding and sequencing (BRB-seq), yeast one/two-hybrid assays,
  mammalian one-hybrid assays, and AlphaFold3 structural predictions to
  analyze host gene expression changes, pathway enrichment, and functional
  similarity between viral and human transcription factors.

